{"name":"Airborne","hex":"#a2c2d0","fetched":"2026-10-11","looked":{"definitions":[{"term":"airborne","whole":true,"parts":[{"part":"Adjective","definitions":["In or carried by the air.","In flight."]},{"part":"Noun","definitions":["Military infantry intended to be transported by air and delivered to the battlefield by parachute or helicopter."]}],"link":"https://en.wiktionary.org/wiki/airborne"}],"entries":[{"title":"Airborne (1962 film)","blocks":[{"text":"Airborne is a 1962 American drama film written and directed by James Landis and starring Bobby Diamond. As of 2009 it is in the Public Domain and can be streamed on YouTube or downloaded via the Internet Archive. The film tells the story of a young man (Diamond) and his journey to become a US paratrooper."}],"image":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/en/b/b4/Abnpos.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail_unscaled","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Airborne_(1962_film)"},{"title":"Airborne (1993 film)","blocks":[{"text":"Airborne is a 1993 American comedy-drama film about inline skating directed by Rob Bowman in his feature film directorial debut, and starring Shane McDermott, Seth Green, Brittney Powell, Chris Conrad, Jacob Vargas and Jack Black."}],"image":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/en/6/6f/Airborne93poster.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail_unscaled","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Airborne_(1993_film)"}],"images":[{"srcset":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/7/7d/Bobby_Diamond_in_%22Airborne%22_%281962%29.jpg/500px-Bobby_Diamond_in_%22Airborne%22_%281962%29.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 1x","src":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/7/7d/Bobby_Diamond_in_%22Airborne%22_%281962%29.jpg/500px-Bobby_Diamond_in_%22Airborne%22_%281962%29.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail","alt":"Bobby Diamond in Airborne",